------------------------------------------------------------
The bench device had no CYVRA agent (0 of 333 packages), so it could not be
purged at all. Before any destructive step:

  - sanitization-agent-debug.apk installed  (needed `adb install -r -t`,
    because a debug build is flagged testOnly)
